<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-CA TROPHY SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CA TROPHY SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the CA Trophy men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding): Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France) 7-6 (9-7) 6-4</p>
<p>5-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Todd Martin (U.S) 3-6 6-4 6-2</p>
